<title>UK: Barr &amp; Wallace in sale talks with Leisureplus.</title>
<headline>Barr &amp; Wallace in sale talks with Leisureplus.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr &amp; Wallace Arnold Trust Plc said on Monday it was in negotiations with Leisureplus Ltd for a possible sale of its leisure division.</p>
<p>Leisureplus is the holding company of a group comprising the Shearings holiday business.</p>
<p>Hambros Bank is advising Barr &amp; Wallace on the possible sale.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
